    "title": "Former EU Foreign Policy Chief Faces Corruption Charges",
    "text": "The European Union's former foreign policy chief is facing corruption charges. Federica Mogherini was arrested this week, along with two others, as part of a fraud investigation.\nAuthorities in Belgium made the arrests after raiding the offices of the EU diplomatic service in Brussels and a college in Bruges.\nThe prosecutor's office said the accusations include fraud and corruption, conflict of interest, and violation of professional secrecy.",
